The petitioner has filed the present petition seeking quashing of the First Information Report with the following prayers:
"A. Rule be issued and recorded and proceedings be called for;
B. This Hon'ble Court be pleased to issue a writ of mandamus or certiorari or any other appropriate, writ/direction/ order in the nature of writ of mandamus or Vikas Dnyaneshwar Gurav vs State Of Maharashtra And Anr on 5 December, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/109470981/
1 certiorari under article 226 of the constitution of India, 1950, and also under 528 of Bhartiya Nagrik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023, thereby Quash and set asid the F.I.R.
bearing no. 791/2022 u/s. 376, 354, 354(A) & 506 of Indian Penal Code 1860 registered at Khed Police Station, Tal. Khed, Dist. Pune, registered with the Respondent against the present Applicant and all further proceedings arising thereof;
C. Pending the hearing and final disposal of the present writ petition, this Hon'ble court be pleased to stay the proceeding before Session Court Khed in S.C no.
41/2023;
D. Interim/Ad- Interim Order in term of Prayed Clause (C) above to be granted;
E. For such other and further reliefs as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in accordance with the law."
 bgp   907.5090.25-wp.docx 2.
